w's fit.\n\nNPF star-trail tolerance (k)\nk = 1.0\n\nFor untracked exposures (Michaud NPF rule): 1 = round stars, up to 3 = slightly elongated. Higher allows longer sub-exposures.\n\nk = 1.0\nk = 3.0\nDew warning margin\n2 °C\n\nWarn when the air temperature is within this margin of the dew point.\n\n0 °C\n10 °C\n\nNo changes\n\nCancel\nSave"},{"name":"browser-settings_privacy-dark100.png","url":"http://127.0.0.1:4174/workspace.html?tab=settings&variant=blend&font=Geist&night=2026-11-10&theme=dark&scale=1","state":"settings privacy","viewport":[412,915],"frame":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":412,"height":915,"top":0,"right":412,"bottom":915,"left":0},"font":"Geist, sans-serif","fontLoaded":true,"bodyOverflow":false,"scale":"1","visibleText":"Privacy\nPlace names\nLook up place names\nOptional: the app sends the chosen coordinates to OpenStreetMap Nominatim. Off keeps coordinate labels.\n\nThis preview stores your choice only. No place-name request is sent.\n\nWhat leaves the device in the app"},{"name":"browser-settings_backup-dark100.png","url":"http://127.0.0.1:4174/workspace.html?tab=settings&variant=blend&font=Geist&night=2026-11-10&theme=dark&scale=1","state":"settings backup","viewport":[412,915],"frame":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":412,"height":915,"top":0,"right":412,"bottom":915,"left":0},"font":"Geist, sans-serif","fontLoaded":true,"bodyOverflow":false,"scale":"1","visibleText":"Backup & data\n\nBack up this browser prototype, or just its settings. Neither file is an app database backup.\n\nFull prototype backup\n\nPlan, Logbook, Library and Settings from this browser. Review a file before restoring.\n\nPrototype backup & restore\nSave preview settings\n\nOne JSON file with the settings on these pages: appearance, units, planning and privacy. No plans, Logbook entries or app data.\n\nDownload settings file\nRestore preview settings\n\nChecked first; nothing changes until you confirm.\n\nSettings file (.json)\nApplication backup"},{"name":"browser-home-dark200.png","url":"ht