idth":412,"height":915,"top":0,"right":412,"bottom":915,"left":0},"font":"Geist, sans-serif","fontLoaded":true,"bodyOverflow":false,"scale":"1","visibleText":"Planning\n\nPlan defaults. Saved snapshots stay unchanged.\n\nCapture budget\nTime between frames\n5 s\n\nDownload and delay after each exposure. Measure your rig.\n\n0 s\n120 s\nFit margin\n15%\n\nShows Tight when less than this share of usable time remains.\n\n0%\n50%\nHow these defaults apply\nImaging window\n\nStored preference · the preview's example window stays fixed.\n\nMinimum target altitude\n20°\n\nBelow this the target is not counted as usable. Low altitude means more atmosphere, extinction and poor seeing.\n\n5°\n60°\nDarkness limit (Sun altitude)\n−18°\n−15°\n−12°\n\n−18° is full astronomical darkness. −15° or −12° give longer windows with a brighter sky background.\n\nGates and optional times\nGates: 0 of 2 on · optional times: 0 of 5 included\nGuidance\n\nStored guidance preferences · no change to this preview's fit.\n\nNPF star-trail tolerance (k)\nk = 1.0\n\nFor untracked exposures (Michaud NPF rule): 1 = round stars, up to 3 = slightly elongated. Higher allows longer sub-exposures.\n\nk = 1.0\nk = 3.0\nDew warning margin\n2 °C\n\nWarn when the air temperature is within this margin of the dew point.\n\n0 °C\n10 °C\n\nNo changes\n\nCancel\nSave"},{"name":"browser-settings_privacy-field100.png","url":"http://127.0.0.1:4174/workspace.html?tab=settings&variant=blend&font=Geist&night=2026-11-10&theme=field&scale=1","state":"settings privacy","viewport":[412,915],"frame":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":412,"height":915,"top":0,"right":412,"bottom":915,"left":0},"font":"Geist, sans-serif","fontLoaded":true,"bodyOverflow":false,"scale":"1","visibleText":"Privacy\nPlace names\nLook up place names\nOptional: the app sends the chosen coordinates to OpenStreetMap Nominatim. Off keeps coordinate labels.\n\nThis preview stores your choice only. No place-name request is sent.\n\nWhat leaves the device in the app"},{"n